    "uniprot_query": "protein_name:\"calcium sensing receptor\" AND reviewed:true AND taxonomy_id:9606",
    "why_now": "The previous threads on pendrin (SLC26A4) and GSDM4 are exhausted and spent. I need a fresh, structurally complex human GPCR-related target to explore. CASR is a classic example of a multi-domain receptor with distinct structural features (VFT, CR, and CT) that provides a rich landscape for structural analysis and ligand interaction modeling, moving away from the 'spent' SLC family."
  },
